1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,920
Past two in the morning.
Ta wakes for no apparent reason.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:09,260
No crickets. No passing cars.
Tonight is unnaturally silent.

3
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:14,380
He checks his phone,
but the screen stays dark.

4
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:18,940
That old charging cable again, he thinks.

5
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:24,651
He gets up, thinking he might
as well get some water.

6
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,413
But before his hand reaches the door...

7
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,739
“Ta... don't leave this room.”

8
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:47,380
A calm voice comes from behind him.
He should be alone.

9
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:52,919
Ta freezes, his trembling hand suspended by the door.

10
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:58,460
Should Ta turn around...
or pretend nothing happened?
